          "message": "fix(security): confine qualification file arguments\n\nKeep G-6 policy, evidence and audit paths inside the selected workspace.\nBind recovery state and gate evidence to their workspace boundaries and\nreject symlink escapes before reading, writing or calling external tools.\n\nUse the platform temporary directory for read-only metadata probes and\ngenerate redaction control values at runtime. Add hermetic boundary tests\nwithout changing the security quality gate.",
